<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's almost uncomfortable...</font>

46
00:03:27,770 --> 00:03:30,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and get here Kakashi-sensei!</font>

47
00:03:30,270 --> 00:03:31,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro!</font>

48
00:03:42,490 --> 00:03:45,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...
Good morning, everyone...</font>

49
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:48,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today I got lost.</font>

50
