54
00:04:02,470 --> 00:04:06,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">where I can use my Ninja Way
and my soul... you know?</font>

55
00:04:07,140 --> 00:04:08,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, yes yes...</font>

56
00:04:09,140 --> 00:04:11,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I basically understand what
you're trying to say.</font>

57
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:18,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap!</font>

58
00:04:19,150 --> 00:04:21,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's always making me
indebted to him</font>

59
00:04:21,990 --> 00:04:24,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and making himself look good
