<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You little...!</font>

62
00:04:36,210 --> 00:04:38,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today for sure!</font>

63
00:04:47,430 --> 00:04:51,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm...
You are so much trouble!</font>

64
00:04:53,140 --> 00:04:55,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what I'd like to say!</font>

65
00:04:55,810 --> 00:04:59,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! What 're you doing, Naruto?
We're going on our mission!</font>

66
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:00,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

67
00:05:00,610 --> 00:05:02,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've been so annoying for a while!</font>

68
00:05:14,660 --> 00:05:17,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not gonna lose to Sasuke!</font>

69
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey you!</font>

70
00:05:27,760 --> 00:05:28,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

71
00:05:29,180 --> 00:05:30,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Mrs!</font>

72
00:05:30,810 --> 00:05:32,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've gotten rid of all the weeds!</font>

73
00:05:33,890 --> 00:05:34,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

74
00:05:34,640 --> 00:05:35,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong?</font>

75
00:05:36,390 --> 00:05:39,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those... those aren't weeds.</font>

76
00:05:39,940 --> 00:05:40,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

77
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:45,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those are herbs
I grew in my garden!</font>

78
00:05:45,950 --> 00:05:48,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch, ouch, ouch!</font>

79
00:06:06,470 --> 00:06:08,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Somebody... help...!</font>

80
00:06:13,010 --> 00:06:17,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way! Free fall!</font>

81
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:19,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

82
00:06:24,230 --> 00:06:25,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot.</font>

83
00:06:35,870 --> 00:06:36,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

84
00:06:36,780 --> 00:06:39,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't go over there!</font>

85
00:06:36,780 --> 00:06:39,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"Trapped field"
"do not enter"</b></font>

86
00:06:41,580 --> 00:06:43,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Please stop!</font>

87
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:48,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That idiot...</font>

88
00:06:49,340 --> 00:06:52,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no! That's because he
stubbornly chose that big dog.</font>

89
00:06:53,010 --> 00:06:56,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey! Wait a minute,
wait a minute!</font>

90
00:07:02,770 --> 00:07:05,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the trap field over there...</font>

91
00:07:07,570 --> 00:07:08,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yikes!</font>

92
00:07:29,010 --> 00:07:31,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well! It's because you're so reckless!</font>

93
00:07:32,010 --> 00:07:35,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, you are so much trouble.</font>

94
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:40,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zazuge...!</font>

95
00:07:42,190 --> 00:07:45,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you act up any more, I'll finish you!</font>

96
00:07:45,690 --> 00:07:50,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mmm...
Teamwork hasn't been good lately.</font>

97
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:52,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right, that's right!</font>

98
00:07:52,740 --> 00:07:55,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke, you're to blame for
the poor teamwork!</font>

99
00:07:55,410 --> 00:07:57,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're always attracting attention!</font>

100
00:07:57,910 --> 00:08:00,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's you, you idiot.</font>

101
00:08:00,750 --> 00:08:03,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't want to owe me
big time...</font>

102
00:08:06,130 --> 00:08:08,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you just need to become
stronger than me!</font>

103
00:08:16,890 --> 00:08:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems like they're getting
along worse than before...</font>

104
00:08:28,440 --> 00:08:31,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...
This is frustrating!</font>

105
00:08:32,070 --> 00:08:35,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There're plenty of guys outside
who are stronger than I am...</font>

106
00:08:35,990 --> 00:08:38,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Always making me go on
this kind of lame mission.</font>

107
00:08:46,630 --> 00:08:48,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then...</font>

108
00:08:49,460 --> 00:08:51,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps we should disperse.</font>

109
00:08:51,960 --> 00:08:56,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I do need to submit a report
about this mission.</font>

110
00:08:57,140 --> 00:08:58,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, then I'm going home.</font>

111
00:09:00,140 --> 00:09:01,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Hey!</font>

112
00:09:01,930 --> 00:09:03,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun, wait for me!</font>

113
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:12,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, how about...
Why don't you and...</font>

114
00:09:12,230 --> 00:09:16,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't we work on improving
our teamwork together?</font>

115
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:19,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're just like Naruto.</font>

116
00:09:20,450 --> 00:09:24,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"Just like Naruto"</b></font>

117
00:09:24,620 --> 00:09:28,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you have time to spend on me,
why don't you practice a Jutsu!</font>

118
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:33,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To tell you frankly,
your abilities are less than Naruto's!</font>

119
00:09:33,510 --> 00:09:37,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"LESS THAN NARUTO... SHANNARO!!"</font>

120
00:09:33,510 --> 00:09:37,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Less than Naruto! Less than Naruto!</font>

121
00:09:41,640 --> 00:09:42,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

122
00:09:43,640 --> 00:09:45,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's always that way for me
during every mission.</font>

123
00:09:46,350 --> 00:09:48,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll never be able to really
do anything at all.</font>

124
00:09:49,610 --> 00:09:55,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan! Just let Sasuke be,
and let's practice together!</font>

125
00:09:58,610 --> 00:09:59,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

126
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:02,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei disappeared.</font>

127
00:10:03,160 --> 00:10:04,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was he being thoughtful?</font>

128
00:10:10,170 --> 00:10:10,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

129
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:16,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pretending to be... a rock?</font>

130
00:10:42,410 --> 00:10:46,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no such thing as a perfectly
square rock with perfect holes!</font>

131
00:10:46,540 --> 00:10:48,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's totally obvious!</font>

132
00:10:49,870 --> 00:10:52,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just what you'd expect from
the man I respect!</font>

133
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:54,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are my rival, aren't you!</font>

134
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:08,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! That's too much gunpowder!</font>

135
00:11:13,730 --> 00:11:15,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With an adult sexiness!</font>

136
00:11:15,070 --> 00:11:18,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Moegi of the senior class
at Kunoichi Preschool!</font>

137
00:11:18,070 --> 00:11:20,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I love factoring!</font>

138
00:11:20,400 --> 00:11:21,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Udon!</font>

139
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:25,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The most brilliant Ninja in the village!
Konohamaru!</font>

140
00:11:25,530 --> 00:11:28,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The three of us together are
the Konohamaru Gang!</font>

141
00:11:28,700 --> 00:11:29,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here we are!</font>

142
00:11:31,170 --> 00:11:33,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew it was Konohamaru
and friends.</font>

143
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:38,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Why are you all wearing goggles?</font>

144
00:11:40,220 --> 00:11:43,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're just copying what
you used to do, nii-chan!</font>

145
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:44,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

146
00:11:45,890 --> 00:11:47,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with the oh!</font>

147
00:11:47,640 --> 00:11:50,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your reactions have been
pretty cold these days!</font>

148
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:54,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, did you want something?</font>

149
00:11:54,980 --> 00:11:56,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See? Cold.</font>

150
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:59,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, leader!
Do you have some free time now?</font>

151
00:11:59,690 --> 00:12:00,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nah!</font>

152
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to train!</font>

153
00:12:04,570 --> 00:12:09,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! You said you'd
play Ninja with us today!</font>

154
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:12,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...? Is that right?</font>

155
00:12:12,870 --> 00:12:13,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez...</font>

156
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:17,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I played with these guys
they would make me hang out all day.</font>

157
00:12:18,050 --> 00:12:21,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmph! Why would a Ninja play Ninja?</font>

158
00:12:28,140 --> 00:12:30,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What is it?</font>

159
00:12:31,270 --> 00:12:33,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, abilities less than this guy, huh?</font>

160
00:12:34,650 --> 00:12:38,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are making me blush
with those stares...</font>

161
00:12:42,150 --> 00:12:44,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-chan, who's she?</font>

162
00:12:47,950 --> 00:12:51,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's been staring at him with eyes
like she's gonna kill him!</font>

163
00:12:53,250 --> 00:12:54,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

164
00:12:54,750 --> 00:12:57,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've been busier
than I thought, nii-chan...</font>

165
00:12:57,460 --> 00:12:58,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

166
00:12:58,340 --> 00:13:00,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is she your...?</font>

167
00:13:02,340 --> 00:13:03,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This?</font>

168
00:13:05,970 --> 00:13:09,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap, you guys are
pretty sharp for kids!</font>

169
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:11,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

170
00:13:12,060 --> 00:13:12,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-chan!</font>

171
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:19,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?!</font>

172
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:24,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! Leader!</font>

173
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:26,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His pulse, his pulse ...!</font>

174
00:13:30,410 --> 00:13:32,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You ugly wench! Ugly wench!</font>

175
00:13:37,620 --> 00:13:38,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

176
00:13:44,510 --> 00:13:45,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

177
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:56,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmph!</font>

178
00:13:59,690 --> 00:14:02,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you all right, Konohamaru-kun?</font>

179
00:14:03,940 --> 00:14:06,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ow...</font>

180
00:14:07,910 --> 00:14:12,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn that broad foreheaded ugly wench!
Is she a girl for real?</font>

181
00:14:24,550 --> 00:14:26,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yikes!</font>

182
00:14:44,780 --> 00:14:46,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That hurt...</font>

183
00:14:46,490 --> 00:14:47,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?
— Huh?</font>

184
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:56,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, I have formally received
the report from you.</font>

185
00:14:58,120 --> 00:15:01,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is Naruto getting along with the others?</font>

186
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:02,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

187
00:15:04,170 --> 00:15:06,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, he's doing okay.</font>

188
00:15:07,010 --> 00:15:09,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been busy lately.</font>

189
00:15:10,550 --> 00:15:14,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I haven't had a chance to see him
even once since his return.</font>

190
00:15:15,140 --> 00:15:16,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm a little concerned...</font>

191
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:24,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you know, Iruka-sensei,
Sasuke is also in our squad,</font>

192
00:15:24,820 --> 00:15:27,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and Naruto sees him as a rival,
which is a little straining.</font>

193
00:15:28,400 --> 00:15:32,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, the result is that his abilities
are developing significantly.</font>

194
00:15:33,530 --> 00:15:34,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Almost to the point that
he might reach yours,</font>

195
00:15:35,030 --> 00:15:35,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the one he respects!</font>

196
00:15:36,910 --> 00:15:38,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

197
00:15:53,930 --> 00:15:54,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder what it is?</font>

198
00:15:57,600 --> 00:15:58,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap!</font>

199
00:15:59,140 --> 00:16:00,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right now?</font>

200
00:16:10,150 --> 00:16:11,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These guys...</font>

201
00:16:12,070 --> 00:16:13,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru!</font>

202
00:16:14,740 --> 00:16:16,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That hurt, little punk!</font>

203
00:16:17,870 --> 00:16:21,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop that. You'll get yelled at later!</font>

204
00:16:21,910 --> 00:16:24,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...
I was fooling around...</font>

205
00:16:25,710 --> 00:16:27,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are these two?</font>

206
00:16:28,250 --> 00:16:31,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey stop!
Let go of that hand!</font>

207
00:16:32,510 --> 00:16:36,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh! So these are Leaf Village's Genin...</font>

208
00:16:36,760 --> 00:16:40,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's play with them before
the strict one comes around.</font>

209
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:45,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let go!</font>

210
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:49,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're pretty lively,
you little punk...</font>

211
00:16:56,740 --> 00:16:58,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerk!</font>

212
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:11,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!
What was that?</font>

213
00:17:12,670 --> 00:17:16,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Village's Genin are
weaker than I thought.</font>

214
00:17:18,100 --> 00:17:19,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-These guys are foreign...</font>

215
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:22,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are they here?</font>

216
00:17:24,390 --> 00:17:25,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru...</font>

217
00:17:26,810 --> 00:17:28,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru-chan!</font>

218
00:17:28,810 --> 00:17:29,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru-kun!</font>

219
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:33,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It... It hurts ...</font>

220
00:17:37,820 --> 00:17:42,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! If you don't let go of him,
I won't forgive you! You fool!</font>

221
00:17:43,540 --> 00:17:44,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the fool!</font>

222
00:17:45,330 --> 00:17:47,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you gonna do
by getting him worked up!</font>

223
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:51,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're ticking me off.</font>

224
00:17:51,840 --> 00:17:55,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I don't like little runts anyway.</font>

225
00:17:56,010 --> 00:17:56,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On top of that,</font>

226
00:17:56,800 --> 00:17:58,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're a smart ass for
someone younger than me.</font>

227
00:18:01,140 --> 00:18:02,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Makes me want to break him.</font>

228
00:18:09,100 --> 00:18:10,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not on me.</font>

229
00:18:11,690 --> 00:18:14,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with this guy?
He's crazy...</font>

230
00:18:15,860 --> 00:18:19,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, after this little squirt,
it's the little runt that won't shut up!</font>

231
00:18:21,700 --> 00:18:22,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

232
00:18:29,750 --> 00:18:30,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

233
00:18:36,260 --> 00:18:39,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you think you're doing
in someone else's Village, you...</font>

234
00:18:42,260 --> 00:18:44,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

235
00:18:49,600 --> 00:18:51,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's pretty cute.</font>

236
00:18:52,190 --> 00:18:53,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-chan!</font>

237
00:18:55,570 --> 00:18:57,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Another little punk to tick me off!</font>

238
00:19:01,370 --> 00:19:02,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get lost!</font>

239
00:19:05,830 --> 00:19:08,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow! So cool!</font>

240
00:19:11,420 --> 00:19:14,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto nii-chan, you're lame!</font>

241
00:19:14,670 --> 00:19:18,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Stupid! I would've quickly
taken down that thug too!</font>

242
00:19:19,010 --> 00:19:19,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmph!</font>

243
00:19:20,090 --> 00:19:22,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke, you!</font>

244
00:19:23,050 --> 00:19:26,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why're you always,
always meddling like this!</font>

245
00:19:27,770 --> 00:19:30,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, come down here,
you little punk!</font>

246
00:19:33,480 --> 00:19:38,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the kind of smart ass
little punk that I despise the most.</font>

247
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:43,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait! You aren't thinking of
using Crow, are you?!</font>

248
00:19:51,710 --> 00:19:54,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kankuro, stop that.</font>

249
00:19:54,500 --> 00:19:55,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

250
00:20:03,260 --> 00:20:05,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're an embarrassment
to our village.</font>

251
00:20:09,850 --> 00:20:11,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">G-Gaara...</font>

252
00:20:13,100 --> 00:20:16,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When did he get next to me?</font>

253
00:20:18,070 --> 00:20:20,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's stealthy footsteps
on the level of Kakashi...</font>

254
00:20:29,870 --> 00:20:33,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no other reason to
summon you here other than...</font>

255
00:20:33,210 --> 00:20:35,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I assume you already understand,</font>

256
00:20:35,500 --> 00:20:37,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">based on the faces
you can see around...</font>

257
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:41,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it's already that time...</font>

258
00:20:42,170 --> 00:20:45,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The other Lands have already
been notified, right?</font>

259
00:20:46,180 --> 00:20:48,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've seen them here and there
in the village.</font>

260
00:20:49,600 --> 00:20:51,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, when will it be?</font>

261
00:20:52,520 --> 00:20:54,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In a week...</font>

262
00:20:55,100 --> 00:20:57,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's very sudden.</font>

263
00:21:02,320 --> 00:21:05,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now... I will make the
formal announcement.</font>

264
00:21:06,030 --> 00:21:07,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seven days from today...</font>

265
00:21:07,910 --> 00:21:13,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On the first day of July,
the Chunin Exam will begin!</font>

266
00:21:33,400 --> 00:21:36,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Cultivate your hunger before you idealize.</font></b></font></font></font>

267
00:21:36,780 --> 00:21:40,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Motivate your anger to make them all realize.</font></b></font></font></font>

268
00:21:40,240 --> 00:21:43,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Climbing the mountain, never coming down.</font></b></font></font></font>

269
00:21:43,410 --> 00:21:47,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Break into the contents, never falling down.</font></b></font></font></font>

270
00:21:50,590 --> 00:21:53,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">My knee is still shaking, like I was twelve.</font></b></font></font></font>

271
00:21:53,840 --> 00:21:57,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Sneaking out of the classroom, by the back door.</font></b></font></font></font>

272
00:21:57,180 --> 00:22:00,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">A man railed at me twice though, but I didn't care.</font></b></font></font></font>

273
00:22:00,640 --> 00:22:04,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Waiting is wasting for people like me.</font></b></font></font></font>

274
