<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

284
00:22:47,770 --> 00:22:50,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry...</font></b></font></font></font>

285
00:22:51,850 --> 00:22:53,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Yes, yes, yes!</font>

286
00:22:53,140 --> 00:22:54,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">It's the Chunin Exam,
it's the Chunin Exam!</font>

287
00:22:54,890 --> 00:22:58,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">If I were to win first place or something,
becoming a Hokage would be closer!</font>

288
00:22:58,390 --> 00:23:00,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">There's no way I can lose!</font>

289
00:23:00,730 --> 00:23:02,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Konohamaru, you think so too, right?</font>

290
00:23:02,810 --> 00:23:03,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What?</font>

291
00:23:03,980 --> 00:23:07,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Who the heck snatched up Moegi,
and what're you gonna do?</font>

292
00:23:07,690 --> 00:23:09,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Stop, I won't let you get away!</font>

293
00:23:10,280 --> 00:23:13,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Identify Yourselves! The Powerful Enemies that have Arrived!!"</font>

294
00:23:13,580 --> 00:23:16,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">As for me, I'm gonna kick butt again!</font>

